{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45201","headline":"对陆迅饮天目山茶因寄元居士晟 · 皎然","name":"对陆迅饮天目山茶因寄元居士晟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"喜见幽人会，初开野客茶。\n日成东井叶，露采北山芽。\n文火香偏胜，寒泉味转嘉。\n投铛涌作沫，着椀聚生花。\n稍与禅经近，聊将睡网赊。\n知君在天目，此意日无涯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}